@startuml data-flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0088CC

title Rule Compilation & Execution Flow

participant "Developer" as Dev
participant "Rule Parser" as Parser
participant "AST Builder" as AST
participant "ByteBuddy\nGenerator" as BB
participant "ClassLoader\nManager" as CLM
participant "Rule\nClassLoader" as RCL
participant "Tiered\nCache" as Cache
participant "Sync\nExecutor" as Exec
participant "JFR\nRecorder" as JFR
participant "Agent\nCallback" as Agent

== Rule Compilation Phase ==

Dev -> Parser: Submit JSON rule
activate Parser

Parser -> AST: Parse expressions
activate AST
AST -> AST: Build expression tree
AST -> AST: Type checking
AST --> Parser: AST
deactivate AST

Parser -> BB: Generate bytecode
activate BB
BB -> BB: Create class definition
BB -> BB: Implement execute() method
BB --> Parser: byte[] bytecode
deactivate BB

Parser -> CLM: Request ClassLoader
activate CLM
CLM -> RCL: Create RuleClassLoader
activate RCL
RCL --> CLM: ClassLoader instance
deactivate RCL

CLM -> RCL: defineClass(bytecode)
activate RCL
RCL -> RCL: Load class metadata\n→ Metaspace
RCL --> CLM: Class<?> ruleClass
deactivate RCL

CLM --> Parser: Compiled rule
deactivate CLM

Parser -> Cache: Store in L3 (WeakReference)
activate Cache
Cache --> Parser: Cached
deactivate Cache

Parser -> JFR: Emit RuleCompilationEvent
activate JFR
JFR --> Parser: Recorded
deactivate JFR

Parser --> Dev: CompiledRule
deactivate Parser

== Rule Execution Phase ==

Dev -> Exec: Execute rule with context
activate Exec

Exec -> Cache: Get from cache
activate Cache
Cache -> Cache: Check L1 (Strong)\n→ MISS
Cache -> Cache: Check L2 (Soft)\n→ MISS
Cache -> Cache: Check L3 (Weak)\n→ HIT
Cache -> Cache: Promote to L2
Cache --> Exec: CompiledRule
deactivate Cache

Exec -> Agent: onMethodEntry()
activate Agent
Agent -> Agent: Record start time
Agent --> Exec: Continue
deactivate Agent

Exec -> RCL: Invoke execute(context)
activate RCL
RCL -> RCL: Execute bytecode
RCL --> Exec: Result
deactivate RCL

Exec -> Agent: onMethodExit()
activate Agent
Agent -> Agent: Record duration
Agent --> Exec: Continue
deactivate Agent

Exec -> JFR: Emit RuleExecutionEvent
activate JFR
JFR --> Exec: Recorded
deactivate JFR

Exec --> Dev: ExecutionResult
deactivate Exec

== GC Scenario (Memory Pressure) ==

...Memory pressure occurs...

Cache -> Cache: GC clears L3\nWeakReference
Cache -> Cache: GC clears L2\nSoftReference under pressure
Cache -> JFR: Emit CacheEvictionEvent
activate JFR
JFR --> Cache: Recorded
deactivate JFR

note right of Cache
  L1 (Strong refs) survives GC
  L2 (Soft refs) cleared under pressure
  L3 (Weak refs) cleared immediately
end note

== Next Execution After GC ==

Dev -> Exec: Execute same rule
activate Exec

Exec -> Cache: Get from cache
activate Cache
Cache -> Cache: Check L1 → MISS
Cache -> Cache: Check L2 → MISS (GC'd)
Cache -> Cache: Check L3 → MISS (GC'd)
Cache --> Exec: Cache MISS
deactivate Cache

Exec -> Parser: Recompile rule
activate Parser
note right: Full compilation cycle repeats
Parser --> Exec: Freshly compiled rule
deactivate Parser

Exec -> Cache: Store in L3
activate Cache
Cache --> Exec: Cached
deactivate Cache

Exec --> Dev: ExecutionResult\n(slower due to recompilation)
deactivate Exec

@enduml
